        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Species: Endoclita excrescens\n- Genera: Castanea, Dendromecon, Nicotiana, Quercus, Raphanus\n- Topics: food plants\n\nFacts:\n- Endoclita excrescens uses a food plant from the genus Dendromecon.\n- The genus Dendromecon contains fewer species than the genus used by Endoclita excrescens as a food plant.\n- Other food plants for Endoclita excrescens include Castanea, Nicotiana, Quercus, and Raphanus.",
